{"id":"liman","qid":"Q2671684","category":"city","type":"oikonym","names":{"az":"Liman","ru":"Лиман","en":"Liman"},"coordinates":[48.81389,38.87333],"coordinatesSource":"wd","region":"lenkeran-astara","regionSource":"wp-az-regions","admin":[{"qid":"Q269986","az":"Lənkəran rayonu","en":"Lankaran District"}],"firstRecord":{"year":1921,"precision":"year","bce":false,"kind":"inception","source":"wd"},"period":"contemporary","forms":[{"form":"Port-İliç","lang":"az","from":1924,"to":1999,"sources":["wd"]},{"form":"Порт-Ильич","lang":"ru","from":1924,"to":1999,"sources":["wd"]},{"form":"Лиман","lang":"ru","sources":["wp-ru"]},{"form":"Порт-Ильич","lang":"ru","sources":["wp-ru"]}],"namedAfter":[],"etymology":[{"lang":"ru","heading":"Этимология","text":"С 1924 по 5 октября 1999 года посёлок (а позже город) назывался Порт-Ильич в честь Владимира Ленина.\nС азербайджанского «liman» переводится «порт».","truncated":false,"source":"wp-ru","anchor":"Этимология"}],"summary":{"az":{"text":"Liman — Azərbaycan Respublikasının Lənkəran rayonunun Liman şəhər inzibati ərazi dairəsində şəhər. 5 oktyabr 1999-cu il tarixli 708-IQ saylı Azərbaycan Respublikasının Qanunu ilə Lənkəran rayonunun Port İliç şəhər inzibati ərazi vahidi tərkibindəki Port İliç şəhəri Liman şəhəri, Port İliç şəhər inzibati ərazi vahidi Liman şəhər inzibati ərazi vahidi adlandırılmışdır.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-az"},"ru":{"text":"Лима́н (азерб. Liman, с 1924 года по 5 октября 1999 года — По́рт-Ильи́ч) — город в Ленкоранском районе Азербайджана. Расположен на берегу залива Малый Кызылагадж в 12 км к северу от г. Ленкорань.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-ru"},"en":{"text":"Liman (from 1924–1999, Port-İliç, Iliich, Iliitch Port, Port-Ilyich, Port-Il’ich, and Port-Il’icha - after Vladimir Ilich Lenin) is a city and municipality in the Lankaran Rayon of Azerbaijan. It has a population of 12,100. The municipality consists of the city of Liman and the nearby villages of Şirinsu and Qumbaşı.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-en"}},"images":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/Port-Ilich.jpg/960px-Port-Ilich.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","small":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/Port-Ilich.jpg/960px-Port-Ilich.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","width":800,"height":510,"page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Port-Ilich.jpg","title":"Port-Ilich.jpg","artist":"Азербайджан-е-Джануби","credit":"Own work","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","source":"img-1"}],"sources":[{"id":"wd","kind":"wikidata","title":"Wikidata Q2671684: Liman","publisher":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q2671684","licence":"CC0 1.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-az","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"az","title":"Liman (Lənkəran)","publisher":"Vikipediya (azərbaycanca)","url":"https://az.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Liman_(L%C9%99nk%C9%99ran)&oldid=9181028","pageUrl":"https://az.wikipedia.org/wiki/Liman_(L%C9%99nk%C9%99ran)","revid":9181028,"revDate":"2026-11-09","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-ru","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"ru","title":"Лиман (Азербайджан)","publisher":"Википедия (на русском)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%D0%9B%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B0%D0%BD_(%D0%90%D0%B7%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B1%D0%B0%D0%B9%D0%B4%D0%B6%D0%B0%D0%BD)&oldid=154939014","pageUrl":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%9B%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B0%D0%BD_(%D0%90%D0%B7%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B1%D0%B0%D0%B9%D0%B4%D0%B6%D0%B0%D0%BD)","revid":154939014,"revDate":"2026-09-10","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-en","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"en","title":"Liman, Azerbaijan","publisher":"Wikipedia (English)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Liman%2C_Azerbaijan&oldid=1379535723","pageUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Liman%2C_Azerbaijan","revid":1379535723,"revDate":"2026-10-10","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-az-regions","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"az","title":"Azərbaycanın iqtisadi rayonları","publisher":"Vikipediya (azərbaycanca)","url":"https://az.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Az%C9%99rbaycan%C4%B1n_iqtisadi_rayonlar%C4%B1&oldid=9209860","pageUrl":"https://az.wikipedia.org/wiki/Az%C9%99rbaycan%C4%B1n_iqtisadi_rayonlar%C4%B1","revid":9209860,"revDate":"2026-11-19","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"img-1","kind":"commons","title":"File:Port-Ilich.jpg","publisher":"Wikimedia Commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Port-Ilich.jpg","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"}],"langs":["az","ru","en"],"verification":"sourced"}